IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `co-rules`

-- Crimes (Overseas) Act 1964 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`citizen` MEANS `an Australian citizen`
`diplomat` MEANS `diplomatic, consular or international-organisation immunity`

GIVEN s IS A `Status`, g IS A `Ground`, cat IS A BOOLEAN, local IS A BOOLEAN, adf IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Overseas case`
`an overseas act by` s `on ground` g `in category` cat `locally prosecutable` local `ADF` adf MEANS
    `Overseas case` OF s, g, cat, local, adf, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, Date 20 3 2026, Date 20 3 2026

#ASSERT `the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `a non-citizen permitted to remain in Australia indefinitely` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `neither` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE))
-- s 3A(2)
#ASSERT NOT (`the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` TRUE `ADF` FALSE))
-- s 3A(3)-(6)
#ASSERT `the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `immune under a relevant agreement or arrangement while working under one` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `working under a declared agreement or arrangement` `in category` TRUE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `working for the Commonwealth in a declared foreign country or part` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `none` `in category` TRUE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE))
-- s 3A(10)
#ASSERT NOT (`the Act applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` TRUE))
-- s 4
#ASSERT `Jervis Bay law applies` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`proceedings may be commenced` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE))
#ASSERT `proceedings may be commenced` (`Overseas case` OF `citizen`, `diplomat`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 20 3 2026, Date 20 3 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`Jervis Bay law applies` (`Overseas case` OF `citizen`, `diplomat`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 20 3 2026, Date 20 3 2026))
-- s 8
#ASSERT `the last certificate day for` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE) EQUALS Date 6 3 2026
#ASSERT `the last notice day for` (`an overseas act by` `citizen` `on ground` `diplomat` `in category` FALSE `locally prosecutable` FALSE `ADF` FALSE) EQUALS Date 16 3 2026
